# Shared arithmetic

`bt` contains problem-independent mathematics used by the active applications.
It must not import `research` or `research_engine`.

Keep generic arithmetic, operators, trits, sections and jets in their existing
modules. Put application-specific mathematics under `research.juggler_sequence`
or `research.collatz`. Do not restore deleted cubic/rewrite research or add
compatibility shims. Read `docs/architecture/overview.md` for the current scope.

Preserve exact integer semantics. `is_prime` and `factorize` belong to
`bt.arithmetic`, not the package facade. Verify changed identities with relevant
unit/property checks and register named results in the theorem ledger.
